cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Panzer's Hepp-bound conjecture contradicts the Martin and c2 conjectures for phi^4 periods"
abstract: >-
  Three pairs of completed primitive 13-loop phi^4 graphs with exactly equal
  Hepp bounds and different Martin sequences; in one pair the c2 invariants at
  p = 3 also differ. So Panzer's Conjecture 1.2 cannot hold together with
  Panzer-Yeats Conjecture 1.10, nor with Brown-Schnetz Conjecture 5. Includes
  verification code, period logs, and a Lean 4 proof of the Hepp/Martin
  incompatibility.
